# Project-specific Actual CSS usage

Copy this file to `PROJECT.md` beside `SKILL.md` and keep only decisions that are true for this application.

This file narrows **how the application uses Actual CSS**. It does not redefine Actual CSS API.

Visual direction (mood, color roles, depth, named rules) lives in `DESIGN.md` at the project root, and the shipped values live in the theme stylesheet. Keep only implementation facts here.

